# Cursor Adapter Rules

All Cursor platform knowledge lives under `src/adapters/cursor/`. Never add `.cursor/` paths, frontmatter field names, or version checks to `src/core/`.

## Version matrix

- All version-sensitive behavior goes through `src/adapters/cursor/version/matrix.ts`.
- Every non-trivial resolver rule needs a matrix entry and a fixture.
- Features without matrix entries resolve as `unknown`.

## Discovery (read-only)

- Never write to the scanned project's `.cursor/**`.
- Only external process allowed in normal scan: `cursor --version`.
- Register invalid agent files with specific reasons.
- Mark same-directory name collisions as `ambiguous`; do not pick a winner.

## Facts corpus

- Verified facts: [docs/CURSOR-FACTS.md](../../docs/CURSOR-FACTS.md)

## Secrets

- Log and cache **key names** only — never env values, tokens, or MCP credentials.

## When uncertain

Return `unknown` with a reason. A confident wrong answer is worse than a missing feature.
